    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Quote lines where stacked discounts (volume + promo + manual) sum past the configured discount-cap policy.
Why it matters: Reps stack discounts past approval thresholds — margin disappears one approved discount at a time. Often slips past because each individual discount looks reasonable.
Suppress a finding: for executive-approved strategic deals where the cap was waived.
Disable the detector: only if your org has no discount cap policy. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
